<article id="post-16213" class="post-16213 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-hidden-markov-models-hmm tag-hmmer tag-pgap tag-protein-family-model tag-refseq">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/07/01/hmm-release-20/"><img width="1100" height="600" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=1100%2C600&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Now Available! NCBI Hidden Markov Models (HMM) Release 20.0" decoding="async" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=300%2C164&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=1024%2C559&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=150%2C82&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=768%2C419&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?resize=270%2C147&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16215" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/07/01/hmm-release-20/hmm-1/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?fit=1100%2C600&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,600" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="HMM (1)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/HMM-1.png?fit=1024%2C559&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/07/01/hmm-release-20/" rel="bookmark">Now Available! NCBI Hidden Markov Models (HMM) Release 20.0</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><a href="https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/hmm/20.0/"><span data-contrast="none">Download release 20.0</span></a> <span data-contrast="auto">of the NCBI protein profile Hidden Markov models (HMMs) used by the </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/refseq/annotation_prok/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=hmm-release-20-20260701"><span data-contrast="none">Prokaryotic Genome Annotation Pipeline (PGAP)</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">. You can search this collection against your favorite prokaryotic proteins to identify their function using the</span> <a href="http://eddylab.org/software/hmmer/Userguide.pdf"><span data-contrast="none">HMMER sequence analysis package</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">What’s new?</span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Release 20.0 contains:</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">18,950 HMMs maintained by NCBI</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">497 new HMMs since release 19.0</span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/07/01/hmm-release-20/#more-16213" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;Now Available! NCBI Hidden Markov Models (HMM) Release 20.0&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/07/01/hmm-release-20/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-07-01T12:20:50-04:00">July 1, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/hidden-markov-models-hmm/" rel="tag">Hidden Markov Models (HMM)</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/hmmer/" rel="tag">HMMER</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/pgap/" rel="tag">NCBI Prokaryotic Genome Annotation Pipeline (PGAP)</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/protein-family-model/" rel="tag">Protein Family Model</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/refseq/" rel="tag">RefSeq</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16155" class="post-16155 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-sra">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/29/standards-sra-data-submission/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Standards for Sequence Read Archive (SRA) Data Submission" decoding="async" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="(max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16195" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/29/standards-sra-data-submission/sequence-read-archive-sra-1/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="Sequence Read Archive (SRA) (1)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Sequence-Read-Archive-SRA-1.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/29/standards-sra-data-submission/" rel="bookmark">Standards for Sequence Read Archive (SRA) Data Submission</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<h4><b><i><span data-contrast="auto">What you need to know for 2026 and beyond!</span></i></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h4>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The volume of genomic sequencing data is growing rapidly, and we want to ensure that publicly shared datasets remain useful, findable, and scientifically trustworthy. To support this goal, the Sequence Read Archive (SRA) is implementing a set of </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra/docs/sra-data-submission-standards/"><span data-contrast="none">data submission standards</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> that improve data consistency, quality, and long-term value—benefiting both the research community and the data submitters.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">Why new standards?</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">High-quality data and metadata ensure that researchers can effectively reuse sequencing data and that SRA can process submissions quickly and accurately. These standards align SRA submissions with evolving </span><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/03/18/ncbi-insdc-minimal-specifications/"><span data-contrast="none">INSDC expectations</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> and best practices in genomic data stewardship by:</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="12" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Preventing common formatting and metadata errors</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;469777462&quot;:[720],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[8]}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="12" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Ensuring that sequencing runs remain useful for future scientific research</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="12" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Speeding up SRA data processing and public release timelines</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">These standards are expected to go into effect at the end of 2026. Here’s what to expect:</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/29/standards-sra-data-submission/#more-16155" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;Standards for Sequence Read Archive (SRA) Data Submission&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/29/standards-sra-data-submission/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-06-29T14:25:23-04:00">June 29, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/sra/" rel="tag">Sequence Read Archive (SRA)</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16159" class="post-16159 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-bioproject tag-biosample">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/23/new-minimum-requirements-bioproject-biosample-fields/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="New Minimum Requirements for BioProject and BioSample Fields" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16162" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/23/new-minimum-requirements-bioproject-biosample-fields/biosample-bioproject-new-minimum-requirements-for-submission/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="BioSample &amp;#038; BioProject New minimum requirements for submission" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BioSample-BioProject-New-minimum-requirements-for-submission.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/23/new-minimum-requirements-bioproject-biosample-fields/" rel="bookmark">New Minimum Requirements for BioProject and BioSample Fields</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="auto">BioProject and BioSample support the discovery, access, and reuse of nucleotide sequence data at NCBI. </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/bioproject"><b><span data-contrast="none">BioProject</span></b></a><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">records provide a centralized place for accessing diverse data generated as part of a single research initiative. </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/biosample/"><b><span data-contrast="none">BioSample</span></b></a><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><span data-contrast="auto">records describe the biological source materials used to generate those data. To ensure data quality, NCBI, in conjunction with the International Nucleotide Sequence Database Collaboration (</span><a href="https://www.insdc.org/about-insdc/"><span data-contrast="none">INSDC</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">), has established </span><a href="https://www.insdc.org/insdc-minimal-specifications/"><span data-contrast="none">minimum criteria for submission acceptance</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">. These changes are part of </span><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/03/18/ncbi-insdc-minimal-specifications/"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI&#8217;s broader effort</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> to implement INSDC minimum specifications across sequence data resources and submission workflows.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;469777462&quot;:[720],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[8]}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">What’s new?</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Starting early 2027, new validation requirements will be applied during BioProject and BioSample submissions.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}"> </span> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/23/new-minimum-requirements-bioproject-biosample-fields/#more-16159" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;New Minimum Requirements for BioProject and BioSample Fields&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/23/new-minimum-requirements-bioproject-biosample-fields/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-06-23T09:45:11-04:00">June 23, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/bioproject/" rel="tag">BioProject</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/biosample/" rel="tag">BioSample</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16145" class="post-16145 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-eukaryotic-genome-annotation tag-genome tag-prokaryotic-genome-annotation tag-submissions-portal">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/18/new-requirements-genome-submissions/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="New Minimum Requirements for Prokaryotic and Eukaryotic Genome Submissions" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16152" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/18/new-requirements-genome-submissions/prokaryotic-eukaryotic-genome-submissions/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="Prokaryotic &amp;#038; Eukaryotic Genome Submissions" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Prokaryotic-Eukaryotic-Genome-Submissions.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/18/new-requirements-genome-submissions/" rel="bookmark">New Minimum Requirements for Prokaryotic and Eukaryotic Genome Submissions</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="auto">High-quality submissions make genome data more valuable for the entire research community. To support data quality and usability, the International Nucleotide Sequence Database Collaboration (</span><a href="https://www.insdc.org/about-insdc/"><span data-contrast="none">INSDC</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">) has established </span><a href="https://www.insdc.org/insdc-minimal-specifications/"><span data-contrast="none">minimum criteria</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> for genome submission acceptance. Genome submissions to GenBank must meet the applicable INSDC minimum requirements to be processed, assigned accession numbers, and released publicly. </span><span data-contrast="none">These changes are part of </span><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/03/18/ncbi-insdc-minimal-specifications/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=genome-submission-requirements-20260618"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI&#8217;s broader effort</span></a><span data-contrast="none"> to implement INSDC minimum specifications across sequence data resources and submission workflows.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;469777462&quot;:[720],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[8]}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">What’s new?</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Starting January 2027, the following </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">new</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> requirements will be validated at the time of submission in </span><a href="https://submit.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/about/genome/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=genome-submission-requirements-20260618"><span data-contrast="none">Submission Portal-Genome</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">:</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;469777462&quot;:[720],&quot;469777927&quot;:[0],&quot;469777928&quot;:[8]}"> </span> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/18/new-requirements-genome-submissions/#more-16145" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;New Minimum Requirements for Prokaryotic and Eukaryotic Genome Submissions&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/18/new-requirements-genome-submissions/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-06-18T16:44:05-04:00">June 18, 2026</time><time class="updated" datetime="2026-06-29T09:52:17-04:00">June 29, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/eukaryotic-genome-annotation/" rel="tag">Eukaryotic genome annotation</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/genome/" rel="tag">Genome</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/prokaryotic-genome-annotation/" rel="tag">Prokaryotic genome annotation</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/submissions-portal/" rel="tag">Submissions Portal</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16138" class="post-16138 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-genbank">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/16/genbank-release-272/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="GenBank Release 272.0 is Available!" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16142" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/16/genbank-release-272/genbank-272/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="GenBank 272" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GenBank-272.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/16/genbank-release-272/" rel="bookmark">GenBank Release 272.0 is Available!</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="none">GenBank release 272.0 (6/12/2026) is now available on the </span><a href="https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genbank/"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI FTP site</span></a><span data-contrast="none">. This release has 57.69 trillion bases and 6.52 billion records.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><b><span data-contrast="none">The current release has: </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">261,460,182 traditional records containing 7,289,942,983,522 base pairs of sequence data</li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">4,756,526,485 WGS records containing 45,628,511,953,497 base pairs of sequence data</li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">1,058,643,373 bulk-oriented TSA records containing 898,651,493,967 base pairs of sequence data</li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1">191,365,090 bulk-oriented TLS records containing 79,162,820,303 base pairs of sequence data</li>
</ul>
<p> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/16/genbank-release-272/#more-16138" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;GenBank Release 272.0 is Available!&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/06/16/genbank-release-272/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-06-16T13:10:08-04:00">June 16, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/genbank/" rel="tag">GenBank</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16091" class="post-16091 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-bankit tag-genbank">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/26/bankit-genbank-submission-update/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="BankIt Submitters: GenBank Submission Update" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16097" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/26/bankit-genbank-submission-update/genbank-submission-portal-4/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="GenBank Submission Portal (4)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GenBank-Submission-Portal-4.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/26/bankit-genbank-submission-update/" rel="bookmark">BankIt Submitters: GenBank Submission Update</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="auto">As </span><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/01/27/bankit-submitters-upcoming-changes-to-how-you-submit-to-genbank/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=bankit-genbank-20260526"><span data-contrast="none">previously announced</span></a>,<span data-contrast="auto"> major changes are being made to enhance your GenBank submission experience. </span><span data-contrast="none">As of April 2026, you can submit to GenBank using our new simplified wizards in </span><a href="https://submit.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/about/genbank/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=bankit-genbank-20260526"><span data-contrast="none">Submission Portal-GenBank</span></a><span data-contrast="none">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">What now?</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="10" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Use </span><a href="https://submit.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/about/genbank/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=bankit-genbank-20260526"><span data-contrast="none">Submission Portal-GenBank</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> for all GenBank sequence submissions, except for sequence alignments</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="10" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Use </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/WebSub/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=bankit-genbank-20260526"><span data-contrast="none">BankIt</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> only if you are submitting aligned sequences for feature propagation</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/26/bankit-genbank-submission-update/#more-16091" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;BankIt Submitters: GenBank Submission Update&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/26/bankit-genbank-submission-update/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-05-26T14:11:19-04:00">May 26, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/bankit/" rel="tag">Bankit</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/genbank/" rel="tag">GenBank</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16080" class="post-16080 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-comparative-genomics-resource-cgr tag-eukaryote-genome-annotation-pipeline-egap tag-ncbi-datasets tag-pgap tag-refseq">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/21/refseq-release-235/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Now Available: RefSeq Release 235" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16086" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/21/refseq-release-235/refseq-235-1/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}" data-image-title="refseq 235 (1)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/refseq-235-1.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/21/refseq-release-235/" rel="bookmark">Now Available: RefSeq Release 235</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="auto">RefSeq release 235 is now available </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/refseq/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=refseq-release-235-20260521"><span data-contrast="none">online</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> and from the </span><a href="https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/refseq/release/"><span data-contrast="none">FTP</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> site! You can access RefSeq data through </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/datasets/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=refseq-release-235-20260521"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI Datasets</span></a><span data-contrast="auto">. The release is provided in several directories as a complete dataset and also as divided by logical groupings.   </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">What’s included in this release?</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">As of May 11, 2026, this full release incorporates genomic, transcript, and protein data containing:  </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<ul>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 17px;">616,942,961 records  </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 17px;">473,570,633 proteins  </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 17px;">81,124,747 RNAs  </span></li>
<li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="1" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span style="font-size: 17px;">Sequences from 180,620 organisms  </span></li>
</ul>
<p> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/21/refseq-release-235/#more-16080" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;Now Available: RefSeq Release 235&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

