<article id="post-16047" class="post-16047 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-biosample tag-genbank tag-ncbi-datasets tag-ncbi-virus tag-refseq tag-submissions-portal">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/20/access-hantavirus-sequences-ncbi/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="New Data Available! Access Hantavirus Sequences at NCBI" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16050" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/20/access-hantavirus-sequences-ncbi/hantavirus-sequences/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Hantavirus Sequences" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hantavirus-Sequences.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/20/access-hantavirus-sequences-ncbi/" rel="bookmark">New Data Available! Access Hantavirus Sequences at NCBI</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span data-contrast="auto">Sequence data from the recent Andes hantavirus outbreak are now available through NLM’s NCBI resources, </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/labs/virus/vssi/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=hantavirus-20260520#/"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI Virus</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> web interface and </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/datasets/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=hantavirus-20260520"><span data-contrast="none">NCBI Datasets</span></a> command-line tool<span data-contrast="auto">. These data were submitted by the University Hospitals of Geneva.</span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="auto">Access through NCBI Virus</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">To find <a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/labs/virus/vssi/#/virus?VirusLineage_ss=taxid:1980456&amp;SeqType_s=Nucleotide&amp;CollectionDate_dr=2026-03-01T00:00:00.00Z%20TO%202026-05-18T23:59:59.00Z">sequence records from 2026</a>, search for “</span><i><span data-contrast="auto">Orthohantavirus andesense</span></i><span data-contrast="auto">” in NCBI Virus and apply the “Collection Date” filter. To get a quick overview of Andes hantavirus data available through GenBank, visit the NCBI Virus </span><a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/labs/virus/vssi/?utm_source=ncbi_insights&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=hantavirus-20260518#/outbreak"><span data-contrast="none">Outbreak Statistics</span></a><span data-contrast="auto"> page (select Andes hantavirus) which shows the collection location and host for recently collected samples. </span><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/20/access-hantavirus-sequences-ncbi/#more-16047" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;New Data Available! Access Hantavirus Sequences at NCBI&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/20/access-hantavirus-sequences-ncbi/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-05-20T14:57:56-04:00">May 20, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/biosample/" rel="tag">BioSample</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/genbank/" rel="tag">GenBank</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/ncbi-datasets/" rel="tag">NCBI Datasets</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/ncbi-virus/" rel="tag">NCBI Virus</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/refseq/" rel="tag">RefSeq</a></li><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/submissions-portal/" rel="tag">Submissions Portal</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
				
<article id="post-16059" class="post-16059 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-whats-new tag-clinicaltrials-gov">
	<div class="post-image-link"><a rel="bookmark" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/19/prs-modernization/"><img width="1100" height="550" src="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Protocol Registration and Results System (PRS) Modernization" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?w=1100&amp;ssl=1 1100w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?resize=270%2C135&amp;ssl=1 270w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1100px) 100vw, 1100px" data-attachment-id="16062" data-permalink="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/19/prs-modernization/protocol-registration-and-results-system-prs-modernization-2/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?fit=1100%2C550&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1100,550" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="Protocol Registration and Results System (PRS) Modernization (2)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Protocol-Registration-and-Results-System-PRS-Modernization-2.png?fit=1024%2C512&amp;ssl=1" /></a></div><!-- .post-image-link -->	
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/19/prs-modernization/" rel="bookmark">Protocol Registration and Results System (PRS) Modernization</a></h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<h3><i><span data-contrast="auto">Phasing out the Classic PRS</span></i><span data-ccp-props="{}"> </span></h3>
<p><span data-contrast="none">The National Library of Medicine (NLM) has completed modernization of the Protocol Registration and Results System (PRS) and the public website, </span><a href="https://clinicaltrials.gov/about-site/modernization"><span data-contrast="none">ClinicalTrials.gov</span></a><span data-contrast="none">. The Modernized PRS is now the primary system for protocol registration and results submission, and we will continue to add new features based on your feedback! </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<h5><b><span data-contrast="none">Modernized PRS updates and new features</span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559740&quot;:315}"> </span></h5>
<p><span data-contrast="none">Highlights of updated and upcoming features:</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559740&quot;:315}"> </span> <a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/19/prs-modernization/#more-16059" class="more-link">Continue reading <span class="screen-reader-text">&#8220;Protocol Registration and Results System (PRS) Modernization&#8221;</span> <span class="meta-nav">&rarr;</span></a></p>

			</div><!-- .entry-content -->

	<footer class="entry-footer">
		<ul class="post-meta"><li class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/author/ncbiinsights/">NCBI Staff</a></li><li class="posted-on"><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2026/05/19/prs-modernization/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-05-19T13:39:25-04:00">May 19, 2026</time></a></li></ul><!-- .post-metadata -->			<div class="meta-wrapper">
		<ul class="post-tags"><li><a href="https://ncbiinsights.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tag/clinicaltrials-gov/" rel="tag">ClinicalTrials.gov</a></li></ul><!-- .post-tags -->			</div><!-- .meta-wrapper -->
		</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
</article><!-- #post-## -->
			
			
